Vendored MiniMax-H3 runtime subset from ai-toolkit.

Source: https://github.com/machdragon/ai-toolkit
Commit: a472c2e44937c88cbf34f89ef1d465e2cd0ab71c (PR #17 head)

The files in this directory are copies of the ai-toolkit H3 diffusion
model runtime at the above commit. They include:

- src/transformer.py: MiniMaxH3Transformer with update_cache flag
- src/causal.py: KVCache, SlidingWindowKVCache, build_causal_mask
- src/packing.py: packed sequence geometry, sigma schedules
- src/vae.py: MiniMaxH3VideoVAE (causal 3D-CNN + ViT decoder)
- src/audio_vae.py: MiniMaxH3AudioVAE (DAC encoder + BigVGAN decoder)
- src/pipeline.py: MiniMaxH3Pipeline (reference sampling loop)
- src/text_encoder.py: trim_caption_tokens
- artifacts.py: ModelPackage, validate_package
- schemas/model-package-v1.schema.json: package schema

The ai-toolkit license terms apply to these files. See the ai-toolkit
repository for the full license text.
